e. As Mizuki attempts to become closer to him, Kuze attempts to push her away—the tale of their budding relationship is darkened with undertones of an imminent tragedy.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":81,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Rape","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Age Gap","rank":72,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ghost","rank":64,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Drawing","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Classical Music","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Bullying","rank":57,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Foreign","rank":56,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":54,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Twins","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School Club","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Snowscape","rank":25,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"ef ~ A Tale of Melodies","english":"ef ~ A Tale of Melodies","native":"ef - a tale of melodies.","romaji":"ef: a tale of melodies.","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"悠久之翼2"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"ef2"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}